# Chat Session Report - Admin Panel Name Sorting Fix & File Management

### Session Summary
- **Date:** January 2025
- **Version:** 0.9.15 → 0.9.16 (Patch Increment)
- **Work Type:** Bug Fix - Admin Panel Sorting & Git Configuration

### What We Accomplished

#### 1. Fixed Admin Panel Name Sorting
- **Root Cause Identified** - Sorting function was reading character name from wrong column index (index 1 instead of 0)
- **Column Index Fix** - Updated `sortTable()` function in `js/admin_panel.js` to read from `aCells[0]` instead of `aCells[1]`
- **Sorting Functionality** - Character name column now properly sorts A-Z and Z-A when clicked
- **Visual Feedback** - Sort icon correctly updates to show current sort direction (▲ ascending, ▼ descending)

