### Technical Implementation Details

#### JavaScript Changes (`js/admin_panel.js`)
- **Sort Function Fix** - Line 168: Changed `aCells[1]` to `aCells[0]` for character_name sorting
- **Column Structure** - Table has 2 columns: Character Name (index 0) and Actions (index 1)
- **Sort Logic** - Sorting now correctly reads character name from first column

#### Git Configuration Changes (`.gitignore`)
- **Removed Rules**:
  - `reference/Characters/Images/` (directory ignore)
  - `*.webp` (global ignore)
  - `*.jpg` (global ignore)
  - `*.jpeg` (global ignore)
  - `*.png` (global ignore)
- **Impact** - All image files can now be tracked, not just in specific directories

### Bug Fixes Summary

1. **Name Sorting Not Working** ✅
   - **Root Cause**: Sorting function reading from column index 1 (Actions column) instead of index 0 (Character Name column)
   - **Fix**: Changed `aCells[1]` to `aCells[0]` in `sortTable()` function for `character_name` case
   - **Result**: Clicking "Character Name" header now properly sorts characters alphabetically

